# Git commits — no Cursor contributor

When creating commits for this repository:

- Use the repository owner's existing `user.name` / `user.email` only. Do not change git config.
- Never add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, Composer, or any AI agent.
- Do not set commit author/committer to Cursor, GitHub Copilot, or bot identities.
- Keep commit messages factual; no "Generated by Cursor" footers.

Goal: GitHub contributors must reflect humans on this project, not the IDE agent.
